  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Musariri Meadow Hill</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demand for free-range chickens exceeds supply; and Zambian supermarkets cannot buy enough processed chickens in bulk. Sam is investing in bird stock; processing equipment and cold storage units; in order to source directly from over 1;000 rural supplier households and sell directly to consumers in urban areas.</narrative>
  </description>
